Package: ModalForecast
Title: Parametric Modal ARIMA Models using Skew Normal Distribution
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Christian", "Galarza", email = "chedgala@espol.edu.ec", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements parametric modal ARIMA models utilizing the Skew Normal (Two-Piece Normal) distribution. The conditional mode is parameterized and optimized via maximum likelihood using analytical gradients. Includes comprehensive residual diagnostics, robust parametric bootstrap prediction intervals, and classical asymptotic inference via the Fisher Information matrix.
URL: https://github.com/chedgala/ModalForecast
BugReports: https://github.com/chedgala/ModalForecast/issues
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
